{"nodes": [{"id": "claude", "label": "CLAUDE.md - Project Guide", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_minimum_lap_time_problem", "label": "Minimum-Lap-Time Problem (MLTP)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Racing line posed as an optimal-control problem in the track arc-length domain, transcribed by direct Legendre collocation and solved as an NLP with IPOPT; a Python port of the MATLAB FullModel_4EM_Suspension_FullTyre framework."}, {"id": "claude_space_domain_formulation", "label": "Space-domain (arc-length) ODE formulation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Independent variable is arc-length s, so lap time becomes the integral of sf=(1-n*kappa)/(vx*cos(eps)-vy*sin(eps)) (dt/ds) over a fixed track length; every derivative in m.dx is multiplied by sf and sf is also the lap-time integrand L. Curvilinear coords: n lateral offset, eps heading error, kappa>0 left turn."}, {"id": "claude_direct_legendre_collocation", "label": "Direct Legendre collocation transcription", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Grid step OPT_ds=30 m, degree OPT_d=3, linear input interpolation; decision vector w=[Xk;Uk;(Yk);Xkj(;P)] packed column-major (order='F') to match MATLAB; NaN in Xi/Xf means a free boundary state; objective J=sum Qk*B*dsk + regularisation."}, {"id": "claude_ctx_spine", "label": "ctx spine (single mutable Ctx)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A SimpleNamespace subclass replaces MATLAB's base workspace and is threaded through every stage; each stage mutates ctx in place and returns it. Namespaces: vp, pt, mf, aero, track, opts, Xi/Xf, m7/m23/data."}, {"id": "claude_two_stage_solve", "label": "Two-stage solve (7-state warm start to 23-state)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A reduced 7-state bicycle model solves a cheap OCP whose solution is interpolated onto the 23-state grid as a warm start (Results/init_<circuit>.mat); MLTP() calls MLTP_initial(save=False) itself when warm_start=None. The init model is deliberately reduced, not obsolete."}, {"id": "claude_normalised_state_scaling", "label": "Normalised state/control scaling", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "x/u are scaled symbols; physical values (vx=100*vx_n) are reconstructed inside the equations and m.dx is divided by the scale vector; optimal values must be rescaled with m.x_s/m.u_s."}, {"id": "claude_config_dependent_control_vector", "label": "Config-dependent control vector", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Control length varies with config: 1 or 4 motor torques (pt.EM4), T_brake, 4 ATD inputs if pt.ATD, 0/1/2/4 active-aero inputs per vp.ActAero, steering delta last; assembled in MATLAB order. Path-constraint count also changes with EM4/ATD."}, {"id": "claude_full_23_state_vector", "label": "Full 23-state vector", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "vx, vy, r, n, eps, Om_fl/fr/rl/rr, zs, zsdot, theta, thetadot, phi, phidot, wu_fl..rr, zt_fl..rr; no aux variables (ny=0). 4EM=four per-corner motors, Suspension=heave/pitch/roll+unsprung+tyre deflection, FullTyre=Pacejka 5.2 combined slip."}, {"id": "claude_wheel_radius_gear_quirk", "label": "Wheel-radius / gear quirk (intentional)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Powertrain sets vp.Rw=0.3142857 and derives vp.gear from it; vehParams then overwrites vp.Rw=0.355 but deliberately does not recompute gear. test_params_useropts.py asserts this; do not 'fix'."}, {"id": "claude_plain_script_tests", "label": "Plain-script test convention (no pytest)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "test_*.py are plain scripts whose asserts run at module top level via an ok(name, cond) helper; the finest selectable unit is a whole file and there is no run-all command. They cover only the casadi-free numerical/config core; symbolic models are smoke-tested separately."}, {"id": "claude_synthetic_circuits", "label": "Synthetic circuits (analytic curvature)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Any circuit name not in _REAL_CIRCUITS is synthetic: curvature generated analytically by _synthetic_curvature (Straight, Hairpin, Sturn, Circle, ZigZag, ZigZagMirror, VirtualTrack); no .mat needed, so ideal for fast tests and benchmarks."}, {"id": "claude_real_circuits", "label": "Real circuits (.mat in Circuits/)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "_REAL_CIRCUITS maps BCN to Barcelona_circuit.mat plus sector splits BCN_S1/S2/S3, Jarama, Spa, BCNAssetto."}, {"id": "claude_atd_em4_guard", "label": "ATD + Electric_4Motors mutual exclusion", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If ATD and Electric_4Motors are both On, userOpts forces ATD=Off with a warning."}, {"id": "claude_pacejka_52_full_tyre_model", "label": "Full Pacejka 5.2 tyre model (ctx.mf)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "~60 coefficients, combined slip on both axes, used only by vehModel.py."}, {"id": "claude_simplified_tyre_vp_tyre", "label": "Simplified 8-parameter tyre (vp.tyre)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lumped Magic-Formula tyre used only by vehModel_initial.py; must not be conflated with the full Pacejka ctx.mf."}, {"id": "claude_data_aa_mat", "label": "DATA_AA.mat aerodynamic coefficients", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Required for a real solve. vehParams only warns and falls back to placeholder Cd/Cl when missing, but vehModel raises RuntimeError if ctx.aero is None."}, {"id": "claude_ipopt", "label": "IPOPT (bundled in the CasADi wheel)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_casadi", "label": "CasADi", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Symbolic modelling, ca.Function, nlpsol('ipopt'), collocation helpers; installed wheel is 3.7.2 (>=3.6 required)."}, {"id": "claude_mumps", "label": "MUMPS linear solver", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bundled inside the casadi wheel and needs no external library, so it is the always-available fallback linear solver."}, {"id": "claude_coin_hsl", "label": "Coin-HSL linear solvers (MA57/MA97/MA27)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "HSL solvers factorise ~4-5x faster per IPOPT iteration than MUMPS; they need a Coin-HSL shared library (the MinGW/libgfortran5 CoinHSL_jll build matches the casadi wheel's ABI), located via COINHSL_DIR or the seeded default in functions/hsl.py. Licensed, free for academic use."}, {"id": "claude_ma57_automatic_scaling", "label": "ma57 MC64 automatic scaling", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ma57_automatic_scaling is set automatically in functions/hsl.py so MA57 converges on the stiff 23-state problem, where unscaled MA57 can stall."}, {"id": "claude_per_iteration_linear_solver_cost", "label": "Per-iteration linear-solver cost metric", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The apples-to-apples benchmark metric: total wall-clock depends on how many iterations each solver takes on this nonconvex problem, so compare linear-solver cost per IPOPT iteration."}, {"id": "claude_stale_root_init", "label": "Stale root __init__.py", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The root __init__.py imports .importfile/.collocation/.context which live under functions/, so importing the repo root as a package raises ImportError; import submodules directly as the tests do."}, {"id": "claude_degrees_vs_radians_fields", "label": "Degree vs radian field companions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Units are SI by convention only; some aero AoA and camber/toe fields are stored in degrees with separate *_rad companions, so mixing them is an easy bug."}, {"id": "claude_powertrain_ratings", "label": "Powertrain ratings (not a map)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Powertrain.py stores only 5 scalar ratings (Pmax, Tmax, OMmax, Vmax, eff); eff=0.9 is used only in the post-solve energy integral; actual power/rpm limits are enforced in MLTP.py/vehModel.py; pt.EM4/pt.ATD are set later by userOpts."}, {"id": "claude_co_optimisation_design_params", "label": "Design-parameter co-optimisation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Static vp fields are promoted to constant-over-lap decision variables solved jointly with the racing line via optimise_design(param_specs, tag) with param_specs=(vp_field, lower, upper); defaults brkB, Tdist, alpha_FL/FR/RW/TW; MLTP_TyreOptim promotes only Fz0_shift."}], "edges": [{"source": "claude", "target": "mltp_mltp", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "mltp_initial_mltp_initial", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "mltp_paramoptim_mltp_paramoptim", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "mltp_paramoptim_optimise_design", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "mltp_tyreoptim_mltp_tyreoptim", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "mltp_build_path_constraints", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "mltp_warmstart_guesses", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "vehmodel_vehmodel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "vehmodel_initial_vehmodel_initial", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "vehparams_vehparams", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "useropts_useropts", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude", "target": "useropts_